{"id":"a367afa8f5a9f1f9","group":"43","path":"43/43-cor-random-no-minimal-degree.md","title":"Martin-Löf随机点不具有极小度","display":"cor-random-no-minimal-degree — Martin-Löf随机点不具有极小度","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-cor-random-no-minimal-degree","aliases":["43-cor-random-no-minimal-degree"],"display":"cor-random-no-minimal-degree — Martin-Löf随机点不具有极小度","depends_on":["[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-minimal-degree]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]","[[43-df-turing-join]]","[[43-thm-random-computable-subsequence]]","[[43-thm-random-join-incomparable]]","[[43-thm-ml-nondeg]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§11.6 Corollary 11.6.4，印刷262，PDF282","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false,"local_proof_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-cor-random-no-minimal-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-cor-random-no-minimal-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-random-no-minimal-degree — Martin-Löf随机点不具有极小度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"359687813e23c2b7\" href=\"?note=359687813e23c2b7\" title=\"43-df-minimal-degree\">43-df-minimal-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"44b1d859aba5ef96\" href=\"?note=44b1d859aba5ef96\" title=\"43-thm-random-computable-subsequence\">43-thm-random-computable-subsequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a7de81180aabd02e\" href=\"?note=a7de81180aabd02e\" title=\"43-thm-random-join-incomparable\">43-thm-random-join-incomparable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f09cedc938e5d69c\" href=\"?note=f09cedc938e5d69c\" title=\"43-thm-ml-nondeg\">43-thm-ml-nondeg</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§11.6 Corollary 11.6.4，印刷262，PDF282"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MinimalDegree}\">\\(\\operatorname{MinimalDegree}\\)</span> 按其特征集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:X(n)=1\\}\">\\(\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:X(n)=1\\}\\)</span> 解释。相关定义与结论见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"359687813e23c2b7\" href=\"?note=359687813e23c2b7\" title=\"43-df-minimal-degree\">43-df-minimal-degree</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"44b1d859aba5ef96\" href=\"?note=44b1d859aba5ef96\" title=\"43-thm-random-computable-subsequence\">43-thm-random-computable-subsequence</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"a7de81180aabd02e\" href=\"?note=a7de81180aabd02e\" title=\"43-thm-random-join-incomparable\">43-thm-random-join-incomparable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"f09cedc938e5d69c\" href=\"?note=f09cedc938e5d69c\" title=\"43-thm-ml-nondeg\">43-thm-ml-nondeg</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{MinimalDegree}(\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:X(n)=1\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\operatorname{MinimalDegree}(\\{n\\in\\mathbb N:X(n)=1\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：取偶数位A和奇数位B，则X=A⊕B。两列分别随机，故A不可计算。A≤T X；若X≤T A，则B≤T A，与联合随机两半不可比矛盾。因此A给出严格介于零度与X度之间的度，违反极小性。该构造也说明结论针对整个Turing度偏序，而非只针对c.e.度中的极小性。</p>\n<p>来源：§11.6 Corollary 11.6.4，印刷262，PDF282。书内定位仅适用用户提供的2007-07-28草稿；本地推广或推论已单独注明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-minimal-degree","status":"resolved","id":"359687813e23c2b7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-minimal-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"be1278f108eb178d","